    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Developer Overview – FOI Request Processing\n\n**Purpose:**\nStarts FOI request processing once a raw request is opened by recording one ministry request for each ministry assigned to the FOI request.\n\n**Trigger/Entry:**\nSub-workflow started (async) by FOI RawRequest Processing when `foi-intake-complete` arrives with status Open. The input includes the `ministries` JSON array.\n\n**Processing:**\n`Load Ministries` splits the ministries array into one item per ministry (FOI request ID, ministry request ID, file number, status, AXIS request ID, assigned ministry group). Each item is looped through and audited.\n\n**Integration/Outcome:**\nWrites one `foi-process-audit` row per ministry request (process_type = ministry-request-process). No API calls on this path. Later IAO and ministry events for each request arrive separately through FOI Request Routing.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "1a72a856-be08-4427-a969-068895256a50",
      "name": "Developer Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
